  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c59921a22062079419e0bffed4cfa04b, type: 3}
  m_Name: F-01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: F-01
  readyForPlay: 1
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: afet_senaryolari_kaynak_12.md. Vatanda\u015F s\xF6zleri kaynaktan aynen al\u0131nm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
  opening:
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Alo! 112 mi, yard\u0131m edin! Sahil park\u0131nday\u0131z k\u0131z\u0131mla, aniden f\u0131rt\u0131na koptu!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: 912 Acil \xC7a\u011Fr\u0131 Merkezi. Sakin olun, ad\u0131n\u0131z nedir, s\u0131\u011F\u0131nacak bir yer bulabildiniz mi?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Ad\u0131m Selim. 9 ya\u015F\u0131ndaki k\u0131z\u0131m Defne yan\u0131mda. Kafeler \xE7ok uzakta kald\u0131, s\u0131r\u0131ls\u0131klam olduk. Park\u0131n ortas\u0131nda devasa, as\u0131rl\u0131k ulu bir \xE7\u0131nar a\u011Fac\u0131 var. G\xF6vdesi kocaman, \u015Femsiye gibi hi\xE7 ya\u011Fmur ge\xE7irmiyor. A\u011Fac\u0131n alt\u0131na s\u0131\u011F\u0131nd\u0131k bekliyoruz!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Selim Bey, a\u011Fa\xE7 tek ba\u015F\u0131na m\u0131 duruyor a\xE7\u0131k alanda?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Selim: Evet park\u0131n tam ortas\u0131nda tek ba\u015F\u0131na dev gibi bir a\u011Fa\xE7. Ya\u011Fmurdan koruyor bizi \u015Fu an."
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Selim: Operat\xF6r Han\u0131m, f\u0131rt\u0131na dinene kadar a\u011Fac\u0131n dibinde sar\u0131l\u0131p bekleyelim de\u011Fil mi k\u0131z\u0131mla?"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Evet, a\u011Fa\xE7 alt\u0131 ya\u011Fmurdan korur, f\u0131rt\u0131na hafifleyene kadar orada kal\u0131n."
  choiceB: "DERHAL A\u011EACIN ALTINDAN UZAKLA\u015EIN! Tek ba\u015F\u0131na duran a\u011Fa\xE7lar y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m\u0131 m\u0131knat\u0131s gibi \xE7eker!"
  correctChoiceIsB: 1
  resourceA: 1
  resourceB: 1
  dispatchA: 1
  dispatchB: 1
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Sistem: Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m daima a\xE7\u0131k alandaki en sivri ve y\xFCksek noktay\u0131 se\xE7er. Tekil a\u011Fa\xE7lar \xE7ok risklidir ve paratoner gibi davran\u0131r!"
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Selim Bey beni iyi dinleyin! O a\u011Fa\xE7 parktaki en y\xFCksek nokta! Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m ilk o a\u011Faca d\xFC\u015Fer! Hemen a\u011Fa\xE7tan en az 20 metre uzakla\u015F\u0131n. A\xE7\u0131kta \xE7ukur bir alana ge\xE7ip ayaklar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 birle\u015Ftirerek yere \xE7\xF6melin!"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Selim: Hemen \xE7\u0131k\u0131yoruz! Ko\u015F Defne ko\u015F! \xC7imlerin ortas\u0131ndaki \xE7ukura \xE7\xF6kt\xFCk, ayaklar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 birle\u015Ftirdik... ALLAHIM! A\u011Faca y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m d\xFC\u015Ft\xFC! A\u011Fa\xE7 alev ald\u0131, ortadan yar\u0131ld\u0131! Az \xF6nce tam alt\u0131ndayd\u0131k..."
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Sakin olun Selim Bey. Ya\u011Fmur biraz azal\u0131nca en yak\u0131ndaki kapal\u0131 kafeteryaya ge\xE7in."
    fromOperator: 1
